 "ai": "normal",
 "intro": [
  "Cindermaw sits on the lip of the Wound, behind a ridge with two passes. Skarn Ashborn holds it with everything the Host has left, and Pyrehold guards its southern flank. Beyond them both, the gate stands open.",
  "Tier 8 is open: every unit the Concord has is yours. Whoever you helped on the long road may remember it now.",
  "Force a pass, take Pyrehold and Cindermaw, then hold the gate as your great-grandfather did."
 ],
