     }
    ]
   },
   "text": [
    "Aldous Wren stands where Orrin stood a hundred years ago, and the gate does not close. It cannot be closed by soldiers alone.",
    "But there are northern axes on the ridge beside the Concord's pikes this time, and that is new. The Concord will have to ask the peoples it wronged, and this time it will have to pay. Some of them, at least, have already answered."
   ]
